Grants [20%, 40%, 60%, 80%, 100% (TL1-5)] protection to you, your golem and other friendly creatures against the elemental damage of your own bombs, and against external elemental damage (fire, cold, lightning and acid) by [4%, 8%, 11%, 14%, 17% (TL1-5)].

At talent level 5 it also protects against all side effects of your bombs.
